### `getServerSideProps`

The `getServerSideProps` function runs on the server, so we can use it to fetch data that the client needs.

```jsx
// This is a Server Component
export default async function Page() {
  const data = await getServerSideProps()
  return <div>{data.props}</div>
}
```

### `getStaticProps`

The `getStaticProps` function runs on the server, so we can use it to fetch data that the client needs.

```jsx
// This is a Server Component
export default function Page() {
  const data = await getStaticProps()
  return <div>{data.props}</div>
}
```

### `pages/index.js`

The `pages/index.js` file runs on the server, so we can use it to render the data that the client needs.

```jsx
// This is a Server Component
export default function IndexPage() {
  const data = await getServerSideProps()
  return <div>{data.props}</div>
}
```

